            "REV.7.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "REV.7.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw another angel ascending from the east, with the seal of the living God. And he called out in a loud voice to the four angels who had been given power to harm the land and the sea:",
          "anchor": "REV.7.2",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": "And I saw another angel ascending from the east, with the seal of the living God. And he called out in a loud voice to the four angels who had been given power to harm the land and the sea: ",
