          "anchor": "REV.7.3",
          "anchors": [
            "REV.7.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "REV.7.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "“Do not harm the land or sea or trees until we have placed a seal on the foreheads of the servants of our God.”",
          "anchor": "REV.7.3",
          "marks": [],
          "originalText": "“Do not harm the land or sea or trees until we have placed a seal on the foreheads of the servants of our God.”",
